<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{siteTitle}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="radar.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="settings.css"><link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" href="feed.atom" title="研究雷达">
  <script src="radar.js" defer></script>
  <script src="site.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header><div class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH INBOX</div><h1>{{siteTitle}}<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
    <p class="intro">在你关注的研究方向中，发现新论文与技术文章。按关键词筛选，保留原始摘要与命中原因。</p>
    <nav data-radar-nav></nav>
    <nav><a href="settings.html" class="settings-link">⚙ 本雷达设置</a><a href="feed.atom">订阅精选 RSS / Atom</a><a href="report.md">抓取报告</a><a data-source-link href="https://github.com/HzZHoO/research-radar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">源码 ↗</a></nav>
  </header>
  <section class="stats" id="stats" aria-label="收集统计"><span>正在读取抓取统计…</span></section>
  <section class="toolbar" aria-label="筛选文章">
    <label id="recipe-controls" hidden>复现线索<select id="recipe"><option value="all">全部</option><option value="code">代码／开源</option><option value="params">参数／配置</option><option value="data">数据处理</option><option value="thinking">Thinking 数据</option></select></label>
    <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="相关程度"><button class="active" data-tier="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button data-tier="direct" aria-pressed="false">直接相关</button><button data-tier="related" aria-pressed="false">相关方法</button></div>
    <div class="controls"><label>方向<select id="topic"><option value="all">全部方向</option></select></label><label>信源<select id="source"><option value="all">全部信源</option></select></label><label>时间<select id="days"><option value="7">最近 7 天</option><option value="30" selected>最近 30 天</option><option value="all">全部回溯</option></select></label><label>形式<select id="type"><option value="all">论文与博客</option><option value="paper">论文</option><option value="blog">博客</option></select></label>
      <label>排序<select id="sort"><option value="date">最新优先</option><option value="score">关键词相关度</option></select></label>
      <label class="search-label">搜索<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="标题、摘要、来源或文章链接…"></label></div>
    <label class="read-filter"><input id="hide-read" type="checkbox">隐藏已读</label>
  </section>
  <p id="filter-status" class="note" role="status"></p><button id="reset-filters" type="button">重置筛选（保留搜索）</button>
  <details class="health"><summary>已知文章覆盖检查</summary><div id="coverage">读取中…</div></details>
  <div class="list-heading"><h2>阅读队列</h2><span id="shown"></span></div>
  <p class="note">“直接相关”表示命中所选方向的核心关键词；“相关方法”用于扩展阅读。分数仅衡量关键词相关性，不代表成果质量。摘要未经 AI 改写。</p>
  <section id="articles" aria-label="阅读队列">
    {{#each articles}}
    <article class="card" data-id="{{id}}" data-type="{{type}}" data-tier="{{tier}}" data-score="{{score}}" data-date="{{publishedOn}}" data-topics="{{#each topicIds}}{{this}} {{/each}}" data-source="{{sourceId}}" data-recipe="{{#each recipeSignals}}{{id}} {{/each}}">
      <div class="meta"><span class="source">{{sourceName}}</span><time datetime="{{publishedOn}}">{{isoOffsetPublishDate}}</time><span class="tier {{tier}}">{{#if isDirect}}直接相关{{else}}相关方法{{/if}}</span></div>
      <h3><a href="{{link}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{title}} <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></h3>
      <div class="topic-tags">{{#each topicNames}}<span>{{this}}</span>{{/each}}</div>
      <div class="topic-tags">{{#each recipeSignals}}<span>{{label}}</span>{{/each}}</div>
      <p class="description">{{description}}</p>
      <details><summary>命中原因 · {{score}} 分</summary><p class="matches">{{#each matches}}<span>{{this}}</span>{{/each}}</p></details>
      <button class="read-button" type="button">标为已读</button>
    </article>
    {{/each}}
  </section>
  <div id="empty" hidden>当前筛选没有结果。可切换到“相关方法”，或查看来源状态确认是否抓取成功。</div>
  <details id="recipe-starters" hidden><summary>入门配方与项目（固定入口，不属于最新抓取）</summary><p>线索标签仅表示原文提及相关内容；是否开源了完整代码、数据和配置，仍需进入原文核实。</p><nav><a href="https://allenai.org/blog/tulu-3-technical">Tülu 3 全套后训练</a><a href="https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct">Open Instruct</a><a href="https://huggingface.co/blog/smollm3">SmolLM3 训练配方</a><a href="https://github.com/huggingface/open-r1">Open-R1</a><a href="https://huggingface.co/blog/open-r1/mini-r1-contdown-game">Mini-R1 GRPO 教程</a><a href="https://github.com/verl-project/verl">verl</a><a href="https://github.com/OpenRLHF/OpenRLHF">OpenRLHF</a></nav></details>
  <details class="health"><summary>来源状态与覆盖范围</summary><div id="health">读取中…</div><p class="note">首次回溯受 RSS 保留条数及 API 结果上限限制。博客零命中不等于该网站没有历史相关内容。来源暂时失败时，会保留已有匹配文章并标明状态。</p></details>
  <footer>Powered by <a href="{{projectUrl}}">osmosfeed</a> · 无模型、无 API 密钥 · 已读状态仅保存在当前浏览器</footer>
</main>
</body></html>
